{
  "description": "AutoQA eval scenarios. Local /demo scenarios have deterministic ground truth (planted bugs) for precision/recall; saucedemo/the-internet scenarios test verdict accuracy and action success on real sites. `expected_findings` uses {category, keyword} matched against a finding's title+actual.",
